%% 地图 B：系统关闭图
%% 依据：01-startup-shutdown.md 链路 SD-1~SD-3
%% 关键风险：Extension.Close 被调用两次（显式+defer），第二次因 nil 检查空操作
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sig as signal<br/>SIGINT/SIGTERM
    participant M as main<br/>cmd/server/main.go
    participant Orch as SetOrchestratorReady<br/>cmd/server/main.go
    participant Ext as Runtime.Close<br/>extension/runtime.go
    participant PM as PluginManager.Stop<br/>extension/plugin_manager.go
    participant W as 4 Worker<br/>afterReply/eventIngress/event/schedule
    participant Hook as invoke(OnUnload)<br/>plugin_manager.go:431
    participant HTTP as srv.Shutdown<br/>net/http
    participant MCP as MCPConnections.Close<br/>mcp/manager/manager.go
    participant Proc as terminateProcessTree<br/>mcp/transport/stdio
    participant Env as env.StopAll<br/>cmd/server/main.go
    participant DB as Qdrant/Surreal<br/>外部子进程

    Sig->>M: rootCtx.Done()
    M->>Orch: SetOrchestratorReady(false)
    M->>Ext: Close(pluginShutdownCtx 5s)
    Ext->>PM: Stop(ctx)
    PM->>PM: m.accepting=false<br/>m.cancel()
    PM->>W: wg.Wait（4 Worker 停止）
    W-->>PM: done
    PM->>Hook: 逐 entry invoke(HookOnUnload)
    Note over PM: P1-PLG-2: 不注销已注册 Skills<br/>P1-PLG-3: invoke 用 context.Background()<br/>不响应 Stop 取消
    Hook-->>PM: 完成/超时
    Ext-->>M: 返回
    M->>HTTP: Shutdown(shutdownCtx 10s)
    Note over M: main 返回，defer LIFO 执行
    M->>MCP: Close(shutdownCtx 5s) [defer]
    MCP->>Proc: 终止所有 stdio 子进程
    Proc-->>MCP: 完成
    M->>Ext: Close(shutdownCtx) [defer]
    Note over Ext: 空操作：PM 已 nil（第二次调用）
    M->>Env: StopAll [defer cleanup]
    Env->>DB: Qdrant/Surreal Stop
    Note over Env: U-3: 是否等待优雅退出需运行时验证
